And Isaac breathed his last, and died, and was gathered to his people, being old and full of days: and his sons Esau and Jacob buried him.", "words": [[0, 204891], [4, 205017], [10, 205337], [19, 205957], [23, 206077], [29, 206997], [33, 207057], [39, 207777], [43, 207957], [47, 208117], [56, 208437], [59, 208677], [63, 208817], [71, 209477], [77, 209697], [81, 210097], [85, 210277], [90, 210517], [93, 210637], [99, 211522], [103, 211802], [107, 211922], [112, 212222], [117, 212862], [121, 213102], [127, 213422], [134, 213822]]}]}